1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 22=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:01:51,760 --> 00:01:54,800
As expected of someone raised
by Dowager Consort Zheng.

7
00:01:54,856 --> 00:01:56,072
(Zheng Manyi)
Manyi's manners

8
00:01:56,080 --> 00:01:57,270
(Duke Xianguo's Youngest Daughter)
and bearing...

9
00:01:57,760 --> 00:01:59,119
She outshines all the young ladies

10
00:01:59,120 --> 00:02:00,800
in our Lin family.

11
00:02:01,432 --> 00:02:04,140
(Wei Tianxuan, Zheng Manyi's Mother)
I find Xiuru quiet and refined,

12
00:02:04,152 --> 00:02:05,310
and Xiushu sweet and innocent.

13
00:02:05,310 --> 00:02:06,984
(Duchess Xianguo)
I like them even better.

14
00:02:07,519 --> 00:02:08,718
While I was in the capital,

15
00:02:08,719 --> 00:02:10,519
I often heard Dowager Consort Zheng

16
00:02:10,520 --> 00:02:12,359
speak fondly of the young ladies here.

17
00:02:12,919 --> 00:02:14,999
I specially picked out
some gifts to bring back

18
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:16,799
as a small gesture of affection.

19
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:23,759
I heard you often copy
Buddhist scriptures for Old Madam.

20
00:02:24,080 --> 00:02:27,840
These days, the Pan family's Huizhou ink
is considered the finest.

21
00:02:27,919 --> 00:02:30,318
They only made
three inksticks of this kind.

22
00:02:30,319 --> 00:02:31,638
Xiuru, give it a try

23
00:02:31,639 --> 00:02:33,079
and see how it compares

24
00:02:33,080 --> 00:02:34,639
with Li ink.

25
00:02:34,919 --> 00:02:36,359
Thank you, Manyi.

26
00:02:41,719 --> 00:02:44,359
I heard you're prone
to pollen rashes, Xiushu.

27
00:02:46,639 --> 00:02:48,120
These are Qingyang Pills.

28
00:02:48,639 --> 00:02:49,718
Imperial Physician Wang,

29
00:02:49,719 --> 00:02:52,598
who tends to Dowager Consort Zheng,
is skilled at treating rashes.

30
00:02:52,599 --> 00:02:54,638
I asked him to make these for you.

31
00:02:54,639 --> 00:02:56,198
If you start taking care of it now,

32
00:02:56,199 --> 00:02:59,359
perhaps by next spring, you won't have
to fear peach blossoms anymore.

33
00:03:00,280 --> 00:03:01,720
Thank you, Manyi.

34
00:03:04,919 --> 00:03:06,160
Manyi,

35
00:03:06,680 --> 00:03:07,799
come here.

36
00:03:11,840 --> 00:03:14,039
The more I see of you,
the more I like you.

37
00:03:14,120 --> 00:03:17,440
I only wish you were one
of our Lin family's daughters.

38
00:03:18,639 --> 00:03:20,559
My husband feels the same way about you.

39
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:22,878
He praises Jinqi every day

40
00:03:22,879 --> 00:03:25,479
and wishes Jinqi were his own son.

41
00:03:26,808 --> 00:03:28,190
- Young Master.
- Young Master.

42
00:03:41,039 --> 00:03:42,639
Greetings, Duchess Xianguo.

43
00:03:43,159 --> 00:03:44,120
Mother.

44
00:03:45,159 --> 00:03:48,400
He truly is handsome and distinguished.

45
00:03:51,080 --> 00:03:53,959
No wonder he's repeatedly
distinguished himself in the army

46
00:03:53,960 --> 00:03:56,320
and earned endless praise
from my husband.

47
00:03:58,280 --> 00:03:59,999
This is the Duke's youngest daughter.

48
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:01,758
She just returned from the capital.

49
00:04:01,759 --> 00:04:04,079
You should address her
as your younger sister.

50
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:10,359
Manyi.

51
00:04:12,479 --> 00:04:13,680
Jinqi.

52
00:04:14,599 --> 00:04:16,999
Old Madam has been talking
constantly these past few days

53
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:19,320
about Dowager Consort Zheng and Manyi.

54
00:04:19,839 --> 00:04:21,159
Why don't we have Manyi

55
00:04:21,160 --> 00:04:23,360
go pay her respects to Old Madam?

56
00:04:25,759 --> 00:04:27,599
I was thinking the same thing.

57
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:30,799
Dowager Consort Zheng
also misses Old Madam very much.

58
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:31,679
Jinqi,

59
00:04:31,680 --> 00:04:32,999
we have things to discuss.

60
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:33,958
Take Manyi

61
00:04:33,959 --> 00:04:35,679
to spend some time with Old Madam

62
00:04:35,680 --> 00:04:37,360
and keep her company.

63
00:04:40,959 --> 00:04:41,800
Yes.

64
00:04:43,839 --> 00:04:44,920
I'll take my leave.

65
00:04:46,120 --> 00:04:47,159
Manyi,

66
00:04:47,279 --> 00:04:48,199
please.

67
00:04:56,680 --> 00:04:58,159
Thank you, Jinqi.

68
00:05:37,199 --> 00:05:38,800
Resounding Call Pavilion.

69
00:05:42,639 --> 00:05:45,000
I suppose the name comes
from Liu Mengde's lines,

70
00:05:45,176 --> 00:05:47,150
"From this moment,
his resounding call begins,

71
00:05:47,160 --> 00:05:49,000
as he gazes toward the lofty clouds."

72
00:05:50,480 --> 00:05:52,279
Everyone loves those lines,

73
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:53,599
but I prefer

74
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:55,759
another line from that poem.

75
00:05:56,279 --> 00:05:58,360
"All around me, the world falls still.

76
00:05:58,480 --> 00:06:00,360
With a cup of liquor,
the heart grows free."

77
00:06:01,759 --> 00:06:03,159
Carefree and unrestrained,

78
00:06:03,160 --> 00:06:04,519
with a spirit all its own.

79
00:06:08,070 --> 00:06:10,600
Liu Mengde's poem may
be polished and elegant,

80
00:06:10,712 --> 00:06:13,190
but it was ultimately written
in response to another poem,

81
00:06:13,190 --> 00:06:14,776
which makes it somewhat less inspired.

82
00:06:15,639 --> 00:06:16,758
By comparison,

83
00:06:16,760 --> 00:06:18,424
I prefer one written by his good friend,

84
00:06:18,472 --> 00:06:21,199
Zhang Shuibu, a well-known yuefu verse.

85
00:06:25,639 --> 00:06:26,759
Young Master.

86
00:06:36,279 --> 00:06:37,959
What's got you in such a rush?

87
00:06:39,630 --> 00:06:41,944
Yu... Yuchan said the leaves

88
00:06:41,976 --> 00:06:43,304
on this orchid are turning yellow.

89
00:06:43,336 --> 00:06:44,470
Something doesn't look right.

90
00:06:44,480 --> 00:06:46,479
She asked me to get
your opinion, Young Master.

91
00:06:46,480 --> 00:06:47,278
Should we take it

92
00:06:47,280 --> 00:06:49,288
to a gardener who knows
how to care for orchids?

93
00:06:49,439 --> 00:06:50,479
Why are you even asking me?

94
00:06:50,480 --> 00:06:51,719
Hurry and take it there.

95
00:06:53,279 --> 00:06:55,878
Yuchan was worried you'd come back

96
00:06:55,879 --> 00:06:57,159
and suddenly find it gone

97
00:06:57,160 --> 00:06:58,480
and be upset.

98
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:01,480
I'll take it over right away.

99
00:07:10,240 --> 00:07:11,920
I'm sorry you had to see that, Manyi.

100
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:22,880
That orchid

101
00:07:23,279 --> 00:07:26,159
must mean a great deal to you.

102
00:07:33,439 --> 00:07:36,359
I just remembered
I have official business to attend to.

103
00:07:36,360 --> 00:07:37,638
I have to go take care of it.

104
00:07:37,639 --> 00:07:39,120
I'm afraid I can't stay with you.

105
00:07:39,839 --> 00:07:41,278
I hope you'll forgive me, Manyi.

106
00:07:41,279 --> 00:07:43,360
I'll make it up to you another day.

107
00:07:45,439 --> 00:07:46,800
Official business comes first.

108
00:07:46,959 --> 00:07:48,599
Go ahead, Jinqi.

109
00:07:48,959 --> 00:07:50,039
Old Madam's residence

110
00:07:50,040 --> 00:07:51,560
is just a few steps ahead.

111
00:07:51,680 --> 00:07:53,519
Yinchen, lead the way.

112
00:07:55,199 --> 00:07:56,320
Yes.

113
00:08:19,100 --> 00:08:22,159
(Duke Xianguo's Residence)

114
00:08:22,160 --> 00:08:23,920
"Song of a Faithful Wife"?

115
00:08:25,480 --> 00:08:28,599
I return your precious pearl
with tears in my eyes,

116
00:08:28,800 --> 00:08:31,680
regretting we did not meet before I wed.

117
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:35,599
What exactly
is Lin Jinqi trying to tell us?

118
00:08:36,960 --> 00:08:40,119
Is he planning
to remain faithful to Zhao Xingtang?

119
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:43,119
Manyi,

120
00:08:44,879 --> 00:08:46,920
tell me exactly

121
00:08:47,679 --> 00:08:50,599
what Lin Jinqi meant.

122
00:08:51,600 --> 00:08:53,160
Zhang Ji's poem

123
00:08:53,672 --> 00:08:55,288
appears to be about a faithful wife,

124
00:08:55,624 --> 00:08:58,040
but he was actually using it
to express his own position,

125
00:08:58,279 --> 00:09:00,678
politely rejecting the overtures

126
00:09:00,679 --> 00:09:02,879
of Li Shidao,
the Military Governor of Pinglu.

127
00:09:04,279 --> 00:09:07,398
Lin Jinqi realized
you wanted to win him over.

128
00:09:07,399 --> 00:09:09,160
He was politely turning you down.

129
00:09:09,759 --> 00:09:12,160
No wonder Grand Secretary Zhao
thinks so highly of him.

130
00:09:13,799 --> 00:09:15,800
He really is shrewd and formidable.

131
00:09:16,039 --> 00:09:17,560
Then should we

132
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:19,038
still pursue this marriage?

133
00:09:19,039 --> 00:09:20,040
Yes.

134
00:09:20,840 --> 00:09:21,999
We must.

135
00:09:22,759 --> 00:09:24,798
The Crown Prince values him now.

136
00:09:24,799 --> 00:09:27,680
Our family needs him as a son-in-law.

137
00:09:28,480 --> 00:09:31,119
But Lin Jinqi
has already turned us down.

138
00:09:31,519 --> 00:09:32,398
Well...

139
00:09:32,399 --> 00:09:34,320
Marriage has always been

140
00:09:34,679 --> 00:09:36,800
a matter decided
by parents and matchmakers.

141
00:09:36,840 --> 00:09:39,160
It's not for Lin Jinqi to decide.

142
00:09:40,679 --> 00:09:41,800
Besides,

143
00:09:42,879 --> 00:09:44,800
with Manyi's beauty and talent,

144
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:47,599
and the standing of our ducal family,

145
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:50,959
Lin Jinqi is only human.

146
00:09:51,480 --> 00:09:53,760
Once you know what appeals to him,

147
00:09:54,480 --> 00:09:55,959
cater to his interests,

148
00:09:55,960 --> 00:09:57,479
and speak of what pleases him,

149
00:09:58,240 --> 00:10:00,119
you can make him want you

150
00:10:00,679 --> 00:10:02,119
so much that he can't refuse.

151
00:10:16,039 --> 00:10:17,999
This is
the deposed Emperor's eldest son,

152
00:10:18,159 --> 00:10:19,359
Crown Prince Jian.

153
00:10:23,639 --> 00:10:25,160
You asked me here late at night.

154
00:10:25,279 --> 00:10:26,758
Surely it wasn't to discuss

155
00:10:26,759 --> 00:10:28,320
the imperial family's looks.

156
00:10:29,840 --> 00:10:31,479
When His Majesty seized the city,

157
00:10:31,480 --> 00:10:32,879
a fire broke out in the palace.

158
00:10:33,200 --> 00:10:35,599
The deposed Emperor and Crown Prince
disappeared after that.

159
00:10:35,600 --> 00:10:38,280
It's said they fled overseas.

160
00:10:38,312 --> 00:10:40,200
His Majesty could never
put the matter to rest,

161
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:43,599
so he sent Defense Commander Zheng
overseas several times to search for them.

162
00:10:45,799 --> 00:10:47,798
Those are nothing
but unsubstantiated rumors.

163
00:10:47,799 --> 00:10:48,999
They can't be taken seriously.

164
00:10:49,240 --> 00:10:50,920
There's another rumor
going around lately.

165
00:10:50,952 --> 00:10:52,190
It says the deposed Crown Prince

166
00:10:52,200 --> 00:10:54,239
never left with the deposed Emperor

167
00:10:54,240 --> 00:10:56,599
and is still in Jinling.

168
00:11:00,568 --> 00:11:03,680
The bloodshed in Jinling all those years
ago is still fresh in people's minds.

169
00:11:03,752 --> 00:11:05,990
Who is trying to use this rumor
to destroy someone now?

170
00:11:08,279 --> 00:11:09,800
Whether it's true or not,

171
00:11:10,600 --> 00:11:13,199
the Crown Prince has received
secret orders from His Majesty

172
00:11:13,200 --> 00:11:14,999
to investigate the matter.

173
00:11:15,336 --> 00:11:17,350
I hear Prince Han
has also sent a trusted aide,

174
00:11:17,360 --> 00:11:19,479
hoping to get ahead of the Crown Prince

175
00:11:19,480 --> 00:11:21,479
and resolve
His Majesty's concerns first.

176
00:11:22,200 --> 00:11:23,320
Fengtai,

177
00:11:24,080 --> 00:11:26,999
you and I must both
proceed with caution.

178
00:11:30,879 --> 00:11:32,599
More than twenty years have passed.

179
00:11:33,840 --> 00:11:36,696
I'm afraid looks alone
won't be enough to find him.

180
00:11:36,872 --> 00:11:38,190
Before my father passed away,

181
00:11:38,200 --> 00:11:40,890
he taught the deposed Crown Prince
riding and archery for a few days.

182
00:11:40,960 --> 00:11:42,296
The index finger on his left hand

183
00:11:42,300 --> 00:11:44,390
was half a joint longer
than his middle finger,

184
00:11:44,399 --> 00:11:45,760
which was unusual.

185
00:11:46,039 --> 00:11:47,599
He was self-conscious about it

186
00:11:47,799 --> 00:11:50,160
and often kept his left hand
curled inside his sleeve.

187
00:11:50,240 --> 00:11:51,800
Few people knew about it.

188
00:11:56,360 --> 00:11:59,160
Those determined to find out always can.

189
00:12:12,540 --> 00:12:14,479
(Lu Family Painting
and Calligraphy Shop)

190
00:12:14,480 --> 00:12:15,479
Young Lady.

191
00:12:15,480 --> 00:12:17,064
Young Master Lin often visits this shop.

192
00:12:17,096 --> 00:12:19,190
There must be something here
that catches his fancy.

193
00:12:32,399 --> 00:12:33,599
Young Lady,

194
00:12:33,679 --> 00:12:35,160
what kind of book are you looking for?

195
00:12:36,120 --> 00:12:37,239
We're just looking around.

196
00:12:37,360 --> 00:12:38,239
All right.

197
00:13:01,080 --> 00:13:02,999
How much is this orchid?

198
00:13:04,960 --> 00:13:05,959
I'm sorry.

199
00:13:06,080 --> 00:13:08,719
This orchid isn't for sale.

200
00:13:08,879 --> 00:13:10,398
If you like orchids,

201
00:13:10,399 --> 00:13:12,479
you can take a look
at our sachets and purses.

202
00:13:12,480 --> 00:13:15,119
Some are embroidered with orchids.

203
00:13:18,440 --> 00:13:21,079
This orchid is very much to my liking.

204
00:13:23,360 --> 00:13:25,560
I'm willing to pay a high price for it.

205
00:13:27,200 --> 00:13:28,439
I'm very sorry.

206
00:13:28,440 --> 00:13:30,999
My daughter raised this orchid.

207
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:32,400
It's not for sale.

208
00:13:37,159 --> 00:13:39,879
Could you ask your daughter
to come out so we can discuss it?

209
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:42,320
Perhaps if she sees how sincere I am,

210
00:13:43,360 --> 00:13:44,920
she'll be willing to part with it.

211
00:13:45,159 --> 00:13:46,280
Well...

212
00:13:49,279 --> 00:13:50,400
Then...

213
00:13:50,600 --> 00:13:51,959
Please wait a moment.

214
00:13:52,879 --> 00:13:54,199
Lanxiang!

215
00:13:54,519 --> 00:13:55,680
Lanxiang!

216
00:13:55,799 --> 00:13:57,280
Come here for a moment.

217
00:13:57,399 --> 00:14:00,879
A customer wants to buy
the orchid you've been raising.

218
00:14:01,879 --> 00:14:02,798
Coming.

219
00:14:02,799 --> 00:14:04,440
I'll just wipe my hands and come over.

220
00:14:27,840 --> 00:14:28,999
Young Lady.

221
00:14:35,159 --> 00:14:36,959
As soon as I walked into the shop,

222
00:14:37,080 --> 00:14:39,079
this orchid caught my eye.

223
00:14:40,639 --> 00:14:43,758
This orchid isn't a rare variety.

224
00:14:43,759 --> 00:14:45,800
It grew on its own in our courtyard.

225
00:14:45,879 --> 00:14:48,599
Even the clay pot isn't worth much.

226
00:14:49,279 --> 00:14:50,400
I know.

227
00:14:51,200 --> 00:14:53,680
But money can't always buy
what the heart desires.

228
00:14:54,679 --> 00:14:56,160
I simply like it.

229
00:14:56,399 --> 00:14:58,199
I'm willing to pay a high price for it.

230
00:15:04,360 --> 00:15:06,560
How much are you willing to pay?

231
00:15:12,039 --> 00:15:13,599
Fifty taels of silver.

232
00:15:13,679 --> 00:15:14,760
Fifty?

233
00:15:22,679 --> 00:15:24,760
One hundred taels of silver.

234
00:15:33,960 --> 00:15:36,879
Are you really willing
to pay one hundred taels?

235
00:15:39,559 --> 00:15:41,959
Do you know who my young lady is?

236
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:43,920
A mere hundred taels of silver...

237
00:15:44,440 --> 00:15:45,278
That's enough.

238
00:15:45,279 --> 00:15:46,760
Will you sell it or not?

239
00:15:47,399 --> 00:15:48,520
Yes.

240
00:15:49,799 --> 00:15:50,920
I'll sell it.

241
00:16:03,960 --> 00:16:05,359
One hundred taels of silver.

242
00:16:11,039 --> 00:16:12,359
Hold it carefully.

243
00:16:17,440 --> 00:16:20,359
I just heard your father
call you Lanxiang.

244
00:16:21,440 --> 00:16:23,879
I imagine this flower
means something to you.

245
00:16:25,480 --> 00:16:27,280
Won't you miss it?

246
00:16:28,679 --> 00:16:31,280
I like this more.

247
00:16:41,200 --> 00:16:42,560
Take care, Young Lady.

248
00:16:43,759 --> 00:16:44,959
Take care.

249
00:16:46,200 --> 00:16:47,479
Take care!

250
00:16:59,840 --> 00:17:00,920
Lanxiang,

251
00:17:01,440 --> 00:17:02,599
if Yuchan finds out

252
00:17:02,600 --> 00:17:05,720
you sold the orchid they gave you,

253
00:17:05,799 --> 00:17:07,599
won't she be upset?

254
00:17:07,799 --> 00:17:08,879
Father,

255
00:17:08,880 --> 00:17:11,119
if you had given me this orchid

256
00:17:11,279 --> 00:17:13,159
and someone offered
a hundred taels for it,

257
00:17:13,160 --> 00:17:14,479
should I sell it?

258
00:17:14,480 --> 00:17:15,720
Of course.

259
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:17,879
A hundred taels!

260
00:17:18,039 --> 00:17:20,760
Think how hard you'd have
to work to earn that much.

261
00:17:21,559 --> 00:17:25,000
An orchid can't feed or clothe you,

262
00:17:25,480 --> 00:17:27,078
and it isn't worth much anyway.

263
00:17:27,079 --> 00:17:28,760
I'll dig up another one for you later.

264
00:17:29,160 --> 00:17:30,078
That's right.

265
00:17:30,079 --> 00:17:31,798
If Yuchan and the others find out

266
00:17:31,799 --> 00:17:34,399
that one orchid sold
for a hundred taels of silver,

267
00:17:34,400 --> 00:17:35,919
they'll only be happy.

268
00:17:36,359 --> 00:17:37,159
Later,

269
00:17:37,160 --> 00:17:38,479
I'll give them fifty taels.

270
00:17:38,480 --> 00:17:40,079
They'll be even happier.

271
00:17:41,200 --> 00:17:42,078
Right.

272
00:17:42,079 --> 00:17:43,760
Give them fifty taels.

273
00:17:58,759 --> 00:17:59,879
Young Lady,

274
00:18:00,039 --> 00:18:02,439
the more I look at this orchid,
the more familiar it seems.

275
00:18:02,440 --> 00:18:05,040
Why does it look a bit
like Young Master Lin's orchid?

276
00:18:07,960 --> 00:18:08,919
Does it?

277
00:18:11,920 --> 00:18:13,960
Even the pots look like a pair.

278
00:18:14,119 --> 00:18:15,959
Young Master Lin is so strange.

279
00:18:15,960 --> 00:18:17,118
He says it's precious to him,

280
00:18:17,120 --> 00:18:18,984
yet he doesn't take
proper care of it at all.

281
00:18:19,359 --> 00:18:21,919
How could
he display it in a pot like this?

282
00:18:23,759 --> 00:18:25,800
What do you think he should use?

283
00:18:27,440 --> 00:18:29,399
The kinds you normally use.

284
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:32,599
A bronze gu vessel,
a mallet-shaped vase,

285
00:18:32,680 --> 00:18:34,960
a Ding ware flower vase,
and a yarrow-stalk vase.

286
00:18:37,240 --> 00:18:39,159
Even you can see
they don't belong together.

287
00:19:01,680 --> 00:19:04,839
"I return your precious pearl
with tears in my eyes,

288
00:19:05,319 --> 00:19:08,679
regretting we did not meet
before I wed."

289
00:19:15,319 --> 00:19:18,879
Then I'll spare you that regret.

290
00:19:27,784 --> 00:19:29,240
Since they don't belong together,

291
00:19:29,920 --> 00:19:31,720
I'll just destroy it.

292
00:19:32,440 --> 00:19:33,078
But

293
00:19:33,079 --> 00:19:34,679
you only just bought it...

294
00:19:34,680 --> 00:19:36,598
I am the daughter of a duke,

295
00:19:36,599 --> 00:19:39,320
raised under my family's teachings
and brought up in the palace.

296
00:19:39,680 --> 00:19:41,599
Surely I can destroy one orchid.

297
00:19:42,400 --> 00:19:44,200
Of course you can.

298
00:19:47,359 --> 00:19:49,159
Go get the head butler.

299
00:19:49,720 --> 00:19:51,560
I have something for him to do.

300
00:19:53,240 --> 00:19:54,280
Yes.

301
00:20:06,740 --> 00:20:11,118
(Imperial Theater)

302
00:20:11,119 --> 00:20:13,518
(Since the capital moved north,)

303
00:20:13,519 --> 00:20:16,639
(the Imperial Theater has drawn
theater troupes from far and wide.)

304
00:20:16,640 --> 00:20:18,639
(Whenever there is a performance,)

305
00:20:18,640 --> 00:20:23,679
(peddlers, laborers, officials,
and nobles all gather here.)

306
00:20:23,680 --> 00:20:26,079
(Storytelling, music, and singing)

307
00:20:26,160 --> 00:20:28,240
(fill the place with lively chatter.)

308
00:20:52,180 --> 00:20:55,340
(Furong, Head of the Furong Troupe)

309
00:21:00,599 --> 00:21:01,479
Furong.

310
00:21:01,480 --> 00:21:03,118
Mister Lu asked me to bring you

311
00:21:03,119 --> 00:21:05,040
the final act
of The Tale of the Treasure Chest.

312
00:21:08,160 --> 00:21:09,719
Well, this is a surprise.

313
00:21:09,720 --> 00:21:11,598
Scholar Zongbai actually finished it.

314
00:21:11,599 --> 00:21:14,038
Usually, he gets completely drunk

315
00:21:14,039 --> 00:21:15,599
and keeps putting off the manuscript.

316
00:21:16,160 --> 00:21:17,719
When he was slightly tipsy,

317
00:21:17,720 --> 00:21:20,240
I watered down his liquor
with sweetened water.

318
00:21:21,640 --> 00:21:23,439
I knew I could
count on you, clever girl.

319
00:21:23,440 --> 00:21:25,500
Once you've learned enough
to write your own plays,

320
00:21:25,512 --> 00:21:27,030
I'll find the finest performers

321
00:21:27,039 --> 00:21:28,118
to stage your work

322
00:21:28,119 --> 00:21:30,598
for all of Jinling to see.

323
00:21:30,599 --> 00:21:31,479
Me?

324
00:21:31,480 --> 00:21:32,639
Write plays?

325
00:21:33,200 --> 00:21:34,320
Of course.

326
00:21:34,350 --> 00:21:35,768
Every time I go to Scholar Zongbai

327
00:21:35,784 --> 00:21:36,950
to ask for a new script,

328
00:21:36,960 --> 00:21:38,358
he keeps telling me

329
00:21:38,359 --> 00:21:39,999
that once you've learned the craft,

330
00:21:40,000 --> 00:21:41,838
I should stop bothering him.

331
00:21:41,839 --> 00:21:43,119
Learned the craft?

332
00:21:43,440 --> 00:21:45,240
I'm not even his apprentice.

333
00:21:46,160 --> 00:21:48,518
If Lu Zongbai cared
about titles and formalities,

334
00:21:48,519 --> 00:21:50,599
he wouldn't be Lu Zongbai.

335
00:21:50,640 --> 00:21:51,838
Think about it.

336
00:21:51,839 --> 00:21:54,079
If all he needed was for you
to transcribe his work,

337
00:21:54,119 --> 00:21:55,960
why would he teach you so much?

338
00:22:00,240 --> 00:22:02,879
Mister Lu always makes
his lessons so interesting.

339
00:22:03,160 --> 00:22:04,839
I get completely absorbed in listening.

340
00:22:08,808 --> 00:22:10,310
Performers are looked down upon...

341
00:22:10,319 --> 00:22:11,700
(The Tale of the Treasure Chest)

342
00:22:12,319 --> 00:22:14,439
And those who write plays for them

343
00:22:14,440 --> 00:22:16,200
are hardly considered
respectable either.

344
00:22:16,640 --> 00:22:19,240
But let me ask you one thing.

345
00:22:19,359 --> 00:22:20,720
Do you enjoy it?

346
00:22:24,319 --> 00:22:25,439
I do.

347
00:22:27,000 --> 00:22:28,200
Then that's all that matters.

348
00:22:28,359 --> 00:22:29,358
Life is short.

349
00:22:29,359 --> 00:22:31,599
You should do what you love most

350
00:22:31,640 --> 00:22:33,480
to make this life worth living.

351
00:22:40,759 --> 00:22:42,240
There's a new act.

352
00:22:44,799 --> 00:22:46,078
Wonderful!

353
00:22:46,079 --> 00:22:48,359
The Tale of the Treasure Chest
finally has a new act.

354
00:22:57,780 --> 00:23:03,660
♪The wind scatters the clouds,
and rain turns to mud♪

355
00:23:03,860 --> 00:23:09,020
♪A memory rises in my heart♪

356
00:23:09,420 --> 00:23:14,740
♪Faded ink takes on fragrance
as spring turns to summer♪

357
00:23:15,519 --> 00:23:17,040
(Let me ask you one thing.)

358
00:23:17,119 --> 00:23:18,320
(Do you enjoy it?)

359
00:23:21,240 --> 00:23:22,240
(I do.)

360
00:23:22,340 --> 00:23:24,859
♪I watch the long road wind and turn♪

361
00:23:24,860 --> 00:23:27,539
♪Even the clamor falls silent♪

362
00:23:27,540 --> 00:23:33,180
♪The keepsake rests against
my heart as I quietly wait♪

363
00:23:33,260 --> 00:23:35,819
♪I watch the passing years wear away♪

364
00:23:35,820 --> 00:23:39,219
♪Even deep affection slowly fades♪

365
00:23:39,220 --> 00:23:46,980
♪The past falls like
withered leaves into the dust♪

366
00:23:54,000 --> 00:23:54,758
Come.

367
00:23:54,759 --> 00:23:56,520
Let's rehearse.

368
00:23:59,839 --> 00:24:03,038
♪My Lord, uphold justice♪

369
00:24:03,039 --> 00:24:07,639
♪Tell right from wrong
and judge what is just♪

370
00:24:07,680 --> 00:24:10,159
♪We need only
open the chest here in court♪

371
00:24:10,160 --> 00:24:12,719
♪To prove this woman's innocence♪

372
00:24:12,720 --> 00:24:15,239
♪If everything she says is true♪

373
00:24:15,240 --> 00:24:18,798
♪I beg you to find him guilty♪

374
00:24:18,799 --> 00:24:21,118
♪My Lord, find her guilty at once♪

375
00:24:21,119 --> 00:24:24,040
♪Open the chest at once♪

376
00:24:33,359 --> 00:24:35,359
I still feel like
something's missing here.

377
00:24:35,480 --> 00:24:37,240
There's a fire burning inside me

378
00:24:37,279 --> 00:24:38,720
that I haven't let out yet.

379
00:24:39,799 --> 00:24:41,960
Then let's see what else we can add.

380
00:24:42,799 --> 00:24:44,760
What's missing?

381
00:24:54,000 --> 00:24:55,119
Thank you.

382
00:24:56,640 --> 00:24:58,040
I'll take it over for you.

383
00:24:58,359 --> 00:24:58,879
Then

384
00:24:58,880 --> 00:25:00,280
thank you for your help.

385
00:25:00,480 --> 00:25:01,720
It's no trouble.

386
00:25:14,720 --> 00:25:15,520
This way.

387
00:25:26,880 --> 00:25:27,720
Thank you.

388
00:25:32,319 --> 00:25:33,520
Where should I put it?

389
00:25:34,279 --> 00:25:35,598
Just put it in that chest.

390
00:25:35,599 --> 00:25:36,480
All right.

391
00:26:04,160 --> 00:26:07,959
- Good.
- Good.

392
00:26:07,960 --> 00:26:11,239
♪What grievance does this woman have?♪

393
00:26:11,240 --> 00:26:13,439
♪Tell me everything♪

394
00:26:13,440 --> 00:26:17,679
♪My Lord, allow me to explain♪

395
00:26:17,680 --> 00:26:18,798
♪My Lord♪

396
00:26:18,799 --> 00:26:20,038
♪Let me tell you instead♪

397
00:26:20,039 --> 00:26:21,199
♪Her name is Tanniang♪

398
00:26:21,200 --> 00:26:22,024
♪She's a widow♪

399
00:26:22,072 --> 00:26:24,350
♪She should have remained
faithful to her late husband♪

400
00:26:24,359 --> 00:26:26,239
♪Yet she tried to seduce me♪

401
00:26:26,240 --> 00:26:27,518
♪But I refused her advances♪

402
00:26:27,519 --> 00:26:28,580
What do you think, Jinlan?

403
00:26:28,590 --> 00:26:29,838
I told you so.

404
00:26:29,839 --> 00:26:32,838
Wasn't this play
worth coming all this way to see?

405
00:26:32,839 --> 00:26:34,520
♪Curse Guo Qiu♪

406
00:26:35,119 --> 00:26:37,040
As expected of a work
by the Third Place Scholar.

407
00:26:37,839 --> 00:26:40,119
Furong is the one
who performs it so well.

408
00:26:52,440 --> 00:26:57,919
- Good!
- Good!

409
00:27:24,039 --> 00:27:24,999
Scholar Han!

410
00:27:25,000 --> 00:27:26,078
Wake up.

411
00:27:26,079 --> 00:27:27,719
Wake up, Scholar Han.

412
00:27:27,720 --> 00:27:29,118
Someone is trying to harm us

413
00:27:29,119 --> 00:27:30,800
and ruin both our reputations.

414
00:27:31,119 --> 00:27:32,079
Wake up.

415
00:27:32,559 --> 00:27:37,358
♪Tell right from wrong
and judge what is just♪

416
00:27:37,359 --> 00:27:40,038
♪We need only open
the chest here in court♪

417
00:27:40,039 --> 00:27:42,560
♪To prove this woman's innocence♪

418
00:27:44,079 --> 00:27:45,558
I bribed one of the troupe's musicians

419
00:27:45,559 --> 00:27:46,719
and got a copy of the lyrics.

420
00:27:46,720 --> 00:27:48,879
Do you think this chest

421
00:27:48,880 --> 00:27:50,919
holds pearls and a robe woven with gold?

422
00:27:51,440 --> 00:27:53,038
Don't ruin something beautiful.

423
00:27:53,039 --> 00:27:56,199
♪Say no more. One look will tell♪

424
00:27:56,200 --> 00:27:56,679
♪Guards!♪

425
00:27:56,680 --> 00:27:57,399
♪- Yes!
- Yes!♪

426
00:27:57,400 --> 00:27:59,558
♪Open the chest at once♪

427
00:27:59,559 --> 00:28:00,820
Good!

428
00:28:32,839 --> 00:28:39,079
- Good!
- Good!

429
00:28:44,960 --> 00:28:56,399
♪There's a ghost in the chest♪

430
00:28:57,720 --> 00:28:59,439
♪There's a ghost in the chest♪

431
00:28:59,440 --> 00:29:01,280
♪There's a ghost in the chest♪

432
00:29:01,400 --> 00:29:05,639
♪There's a ghost in the chest♪

433
00:29:08,400 --> 00:29:09,439
No.

434
00:29:09,960 --> 00:29:11,038
Jinlan.

435
00:29:11,039 --> 00:29:12,520
There's no one in the chest.

436
00:29:14,200 --> 00:29:15,760
No one.

437
00:29:15,960 --> 00:29:16,879
There's a ghost.

438
00:29:16,880 --> 00:29:21,159
♪Take this guilty woman
and throw her in jail♪

439
00:29:22,319 --> 00:29:24,919
- Good!
- Good!

440
00:29:25,799 --> 00:29:26,919
Jinlan.

441
00:29:26,920 --> 00:29:28,960
That female ghost just now

442
00:29:29,200 --> 00:29:30,800
looked a little familiar.

443
00:29:34,559 --> 00:29:37,038
Someone who could drug
Scholar Han at Qixia Academy

444
00:29:37,039 --> 00:29:38,358
and go to such great lengths

445
00:29:38,359 --> 00:29:40,439
to transport him
from outside the city into the city

446
00:29:40,799 --> 00:29:41,479
is probably

447
00:29:41,480 --> 00:29:44,240
one of Scholar Han's powerful
and influential classmates.

448
00:29:45,039 --> 00:29:46,078
Furong.

449
00:29:46,079 --> 00:29:47,480
Scholar Han is fine.

450
00:29:47,519 --> 00:29:50,040
He must have drunk
tea laced with a sedative.

451
00:29:50,920 --> 00:29:52,518
Once the drug wears off,

452
00:29:52,519 --> 00:29:53,800
he'll wake up.

453
00:29:54,119 --> 00:29:56,560
If everything's fine,
I'll get back to work.

454
00:30:05,720 --> 00:30:08,239
When disaster strikes,
innocent bystanders often suffer.

455
00:30:08,240 --> 00:30:09,879
Fortunately,
you were quick-witted today.

456
00:30:09,880 --> 00:30:11,439
Not only did you escape trouble,

457
00:30:11,440 --> 00:30:13,800
but you also made the play
even more dramatic.

458
00:30:16,480 --> 00:30:18,879
Could they have been after me?

459
00:30:19,200 --> 00:30:21,599
Scholar Han got dragged
into this because of me.

460
00:30:23,400 --> 00:30:24,760
After you?

461
00:30:25,440 --> 00:30:26,879
You're just a young lady.

462
00:30:26,880 --> 00:30:28,440
Who could you possibly have offended?

463
00:30:30,000 --> 00:30:31,639
I've never offended anyone.

464
00:30:36,720 --> 00:30:39,480
The tree that stands out
bears the brunt of the wind.

465
00:30:40,079 --> 00:30:41,719
Scholar Han must have

466
00:30:41,720 --> 00:30:43,679
earned a teacher's favor at the academy

467
00:30:43,690 --> 00:30:45,000
and stood in someone else's way.

468
00:30:45,010 --> 00:30:46,872
That's why they devised
such a vicious scheme

469
00:30:46,888 --> 00:30:48,550
to disgrace Scholar Han

470
00:30:48,550 --> 00:30:49,912
in front of everyone

471
00:30:49,944 --> 00:30:51,820
and ruin his prospects
for an official career.

472
00:30:53,119 --> 00:30:53,999
Furong.

473
00:30:54,000 --> 00:30:55,570
Third Young Master Lin wants to see you.

474
00:30:55,580 --> 00:30:57,630
He often comes to see our plays

475
00:30:57,640 --> 00:30:58,790
and tips us generously.

476
00:30:58,799 --> 00:31:00,320
It would be difficult to turn him away.

477
00:31:02,440 --> 00:31:03,800
I'll be right back.

478
00:31:03,920 --> 00:31:04,960
Later,

479
00:31:05,079 --> 00:31:07,078
we'll go back with Scholar Han

480
00:31:07,079 --> 00:31:08,800
and discuss what to do.

481
00:31:28,519 --> 00:31:29,838
Thank you for your help.

482
00:31:29,839 --> 00:31:30,839
Thank you.

483
00:31:37,720 --> 00:31:38,518
Young Lady Xu.

484
00:31:38,519 --> 00:31:39,919
Furong is looking for you.

485
00:31:40,000 --> 00:31:40,960
Coming.

486
00:32:29,680 --> 00:32:31,159
Father, you were one move ahead.

487
00:32:31,160 --> 00:32:32,679
I'm impressed.

488
00:32:33,079 --> 00:32:34,119
Bring him in.

489
00:32:41,640 --> 00:32:43,679
Life isn't a game of chess.

490
00:32:44,559 --> 00:32:45,599
If you lose,

491
00:32:46,079 --> 00:32:47,960
you can always play another round.

492
00:32:48,599 --> 00:32:50,320
But in a family of our standing,

493
00:32:50,640 --> 00:32:51,839
more often than not,

494
00:32:52,240 --> 00:32:55,000
losing means death.

495
00:32:59,119 --> 00:33:00,679
Useless fool.

496
00:33:01,640 --> 00:33:03,599
You couldn't even handle
such a simple task.

497
00:33:05,272 --> 00:33:06,390
Feed him to the wild dogs.

498
00:33:14,279 --> 00:33:17,240
Even lions and elephants use
their full strength against a rabbit.

499
00:33:18,720 --> 00:33:22,159
The greatest mistake
is letting mercy get in the way.

500
00:33:32,640 --> 00:33:33,760
Father,

501
00:33:34,359 --> 00:33:36,679
I won't show Xu Lanxiang any mercy.

502
00:33:37,640 --> 00:33:39,719
I just don't want her to die too easily

503
00:33:39,720 --> 00:33:41,278
and become Lin Jinqi's obsession,

504
00:33:41,279 --> 00:33:42,960
someone he can never forget.

505
00:33:44,559 --> 00:33:46,119
That does make some sense.

506
00:33:49,680 --> 00:33:51,240
Then we'll do as you wish.

507
00:33:51,920 --> 00:33:53,520
Ruin Xu Lanxiang

508
00:33:54,720 --> 00:33:57,240
and put an end
to Lin Jinqi's feelings for her.

509
00:34:41,679 --> 00:34:42,919
Guihua,

510
00:34:43,400 --> 00:34:45,080
have some water.

511
00:35:03,239 --> 00:35:04,999
Any news of Lanxiang?

512
00:35:14,679 --> 00:35:15,598
Guihua,

513
00:35:15,599 --> 00:35:16,720
you...

514
00:35:17,039 --> 00:35:18,959
Don't worry.

515
00:35:20,000 --> 00:35:23,118
Lanxiang is brave and careful,

516
00:35:23,120 --> 00:35:24,136
and she's clever, too.

517
00:35:24,168 --> 00:35:25,470
Even if something has happened,

518
00:35:25,480 --> 00:35:28,280
she'll find a way out of danger.

519
00:35:29,159 --> 00:35:30,959
Don't worry.

520
00:35:32,800 --> 00:35:34,519
It's all because I was careless.

521
00:35:34,559 --> 00:35:37,240
I thought those men
were after Scholar Han.

522
00:35:38,000 --> 00:35:39,200
I never expected

523
00:35:40,039 --> 00:35:41,399
Lanxiang was their target.

524
00:35:48,039 --> 00:35:49,439
This isn't your fault.

525
00:35:49,440 --> 00:35:50,600
It's mine.

526
00:35:52,920 --> 00:35:54,118
I shouldn't have

527
00:35:54,119 --> 00:35:57,320
let Lanxiang
deliver the manuscript alone.

528
00:35:57,800 --> 00:36:00,439
I failed her as a father.

529
00:36:01,400 --> 00:36:03,198
All I thought about was making money.

530
00:36:03,199 --> 00:36:04,959
I was so busy with the shop

531
00:36:05,000 --> 00:36:07,479
that I neglected my own daughter.

532
00:36:15,440 --> 00:36:16,999
Don't blame yourself right now.

533
00:36:18,360 --> 00:36:19,959
The most important thing

534
00:36:20,239 --> 00:36:22,039
is to find out where Lanxiang is.

535
00:36:29,679 --> 00:36:31,160
The night curfew has already begun.

536
00:36:31,440 --> 00:36:33,240
Who could be visiting at this hour?

537
00:36:51,480 --> 00:36:52,600
Young Master?

538
00:36:52,920 --> 00:36:53,999
Uncle Xu.

539
00:36:54,239 --> 00:36:55,399
Come inside.

540
00:36:55,440 --> 00:36:56,320
Quickly.

541
00:36:58,599 --> 00:36:59,640
Uncle Xu.

542
00:37:00,079 --> 00:37:01,839
I heard Lanxiang is missing.

543
00:37:02,119 --> 00:37:02,919
Young Master.

544
00:37:02,920 --> 00:37:03,800
Uncle Xu.

545
00:37:04,199 --> 00:37:04,919
Uncle Xu.

546
00:37:04,920 --> 00:37:06,078
Please save Lanxiang.

547
00:37:06,079 --> 00:37:07,919
I'm begging you. Please save Lanxiang.

548
00:37:07,920 --> 00:37:08,919
Uncle Xu.

549
00:37:09,000 --> 00:37:10,078
Don't worry, Uncle Xu.

550
00:37:10,079 --> 00:37:11,640
We'll find her.

551
00:37:11,800 --> 00:37:13,959
I came here precisely
to look for Lanxiang.

552
00:37:14,039 --> 00:37:14,720
Get up.

553
00:37:14,880 --> 00:37:16,238
We'll find a way together.

554
00:37:16,239 --> 00:37:17,919
Please save Lanxiang.

555
00:37:17,920 --> 00:37:18,680
Come.

556
00:37:22,280 --> 00:37:24,080
Help us think of a way.

557
00:37:25,480 --> 00:37:26,919
Don't worry, Uncle Xu.

558
00:37:32,199 --> 00:37:33,320
Any leads?

559
00:37:37,360 --> 00:37:38,800
I found this on the table

560
00:37:39,199 --> 00:37:40,839
after I woke up.

561
00:37:45,656 --> 00:37:47,336
Didn't you report this
to the authorities?

562
00:37:47,400 --> 00:37:49,430
Why didn't you give
the drawing to the authorities?

563
00:37:50,119 --> 00:37:51,879
In a city as large as Jinling,

564
00:37:52,000 --> 00:37:55,439
a person vanished without a trace.

565
00:37:56,159 --> 00:37:58,919
They pulled it off so cleanly

566
00:37:59,119 --> 00:38:03,399
that we're afraid any clues we hand over
might go to the wrong people,

567
00:38:04,840 --> 00:38:06,200
not those we can trust.

568
00:38:12,519 --> 00:38:13,879
We suspect

569
00:38:13,944 --> 00:38:15,680
the culprit
is either wealthy or powerful.

570
00:38:15,920 --> 00:38:18,399
He may have people
inside the authorities.

571
00:38:19,519 --> 00:38:21,080
The man Lanxiang drew,

572
00:38:21,280 --> 00:38:22,399
judging by his clothes,

573
00:38:22,400 --> 00:38:24,280
was a laborer with our troupe.

574
00:38:24,320 --> 00:38:26,879
But I've asked everyone in the troupe,

575
00:38:28,639 --> 00:38:30,240
and no one says they saw him.

576
00:38:33,039 --> 00:38:35,320
Since Lanxiang disappeared
from the troupe,

577
00:38:36,199 --> 00:38:37,879
we should start looking here.

578
00:38:46,712 --> 00:38:47,864
When Lanxiang came yesterday,

579
00:38:47,880 --> 00:38:49,350
we were preparing to stage a new play

580
00:38:49,400 --> 00:38:50,540
and were all busy rehearsing.

581
00:38:50,550 --> 00:38:52,420
We didn't notice
what was happening around us.

582
00:38:52,920 --> 00:38:54,160
When I woke up,

583
00:38:54,599 --> 00:38:55,800
the door was wide open,

584
00:38:56,239 --> 00:38:57,879
and the ink on the table was still wet.

585
00:38:58,039 --> 00:39:00,359
The culprit couldn't have
left long before.

586
00:39:13,360 --> 00:39:15,120
The performance had just ended,

587
00:39:15,176 --> 00:39:17,800
and donkey carts and mule carts
were leaving one after another.

588
00:39:18,248 --> 00:39:20,270
The culprit must
have slipped away among them

589
00:39:20,280 --> 00:39:21,680
and taken Lanxiang with him.

590
00:39:26,840 --> 00:39:28,770
Furong. A squad
of soldiers has arrived outside.

591
00:39:28,780 --> 00:39:30,690
They say a nobleman
has lost something valuable

592
00:39:30,700 --> 00:39:32,168
and they'll search the entire troupe.

593
00:39:33,079 --> 00:39:34,240
I'll go take a look.

594
00:39:39,800 --> 00:39:41,080
Seal off the Imperial Theater.

595
00:39:41,239 --> 00:39:42,640
No one is allowed to leave.

596
00:39:48,580 --> 00:39:53,518
(Imperial Theater)

597
00:39:53,519 --> 00:39:54,680
Check up ahead.

598
00:40:22,079 --> 00:40:22,999
Check over there.

599
00:40:23,000 --> 00:40:24,879
Hurry! Move!

600
00:40:27,840 --> 00:40:29,518
- Stand still!
- Stand still!

601
00:40:29,519 --> 00:40:30,640
Stand still!

602
00:40:33,880 --> 00:40:37,039
Would the deposed Crown Prince
really be in a lowly place like this?

603
00:40:37,119 --> 00:40:38,760
Is the information reliable?

604
00:40:39,760 --> 00:40:43,080
We'll know once we search the place.

605
00:40:43,800 --> 00:40:45,999
Is the back entrance covered?

606
00:40:46,000 --> 00:40:47,518
I've already stationed men there.

607
00:40:47,519 --> 00:40:49,879
If anyone tries
to escape through the back,

608
00:40:49,880 --> 00:40:51,559
we'll catch them red-handed.

609
00:41:10,000 --> 00:41:11,120
Sir,

610
00:41:11,440 --> 00:41:13,399
I'm sorry.

611
00:41:13,400 --> 00:41:14,919
I was just going to get some firewood

612
00:41:14,920 --> 00:41:16,640
and accidentally bumped into you.

613
00:41:18,679 --> 00:41:19,800
Scholar Han.

614
00:41:20,800 --> 00:41:21,760
Uncle Liu.

615
00:41:23,039 --> 00:41:24,359
This is Uncle Liu.

616
00:41:25,000 --> 00:41:27,760
He's worked in the troupe's
tearoom for many years.

617
00:41:29,400 --> 00:41:29,879
Furong

618
00:41:29,880 --> 00:41:32,359
questioned all the laborers
in the troupe.

619
00:41:32,639 --> 00:41:34,319
None of them saw anything unusual.

620
00:41:34,320 --> 00:41:35,359
That's right.

621
00:41:35,800 --> 00:41:37,280
Did she ask Uncle Liu?

622
00:41:37,440 --> 00:41:38,399
Yes.

623
00:41:40,239 --> 00:41:41,359
Yesterday,

624
00:41:42,559 --> 00:41:44,718
did you see an unfamiliar laborer

625
00:41:44,719 --> 00:41:45,959
coming in and out of the troupe?

626
00:41:48,760 --> 00:41:50,559
Think carefully before you answer.

627
00:41:51,000 --> 00:41:52,519
If I'm not satisfied with your answer,

628
00:41:53,400 --> 00:41:55,559
I'll have to let
the soldiers question you.

629
00:41:59,000 --> 00:42:01,519
I only want to find the young lady
who disappeared yesterday.

630
00:42:02,280 --> 00:42:03,720
As for the authorities,

631
00:42:04,039 --> 00:42:05,240
I'm not interested.

632
00:42:12,840 --> 00:42:13,959
Uncle Liu.

633
00:42:15,000 --> 00:42:16,039
Lanxiang

634
00:42:16,079 --> 00:42:17,720
is Mister Lu's disciple.

635
00:42:18,000 --> 00:42:19,439
Mister Lu was up all night

636
00:42:19,440 --> 00:42:21,160
because of this.

637
00:42:21,639 --> 00:42:23,118
If you know anything,

638
00:42:23,119 --> 00:42:24,919
just tell us quietly.

639
00:42:25,639 --> 00:42:27,200
Those two soldiers just now

640
00:42:27,320 --> 00:42:29,280
came from the direction
of the back entrance.

641
00:42:29,480 --> 00:42:32,160
Judging by their uniforms, they're
from the Rear Military Command.

642
00:42:32,639 --> 00:42:33,760
Outside the back entrance,

643
00:42:33,880 --> 00:42:36,320
there must be heavy guards by now.

644
00:42:40,960 --> 00:42:43,280
Tell me what you saw yesterday,

645
00:42:43,639 --> 00:42:45,720
and I promise to get you
safely out of here.

646
00:42:47,360 --> 00:42:48,640
Search every corner.

647
00:42:48,840 --> 00:42:50,240
Then check the back entrance again.

648
00:42:53,760 --> 00:42:55,240
As long as you get me out of here,

649
00:42:55,559 --> 00:42:56,879
I'll tell you

650
00:42:57,360 --> 00:42:58,559
what that man looked like.

651
00:42:59,840 --> 00:43:00,999
You have my word.

652
00:43:05,060 --> 00:43:07,740
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

653
00:43:09,320 --> 00:43:11,158
Isn't this Young Lady Shuang?

654
00:43:11,159 --> 00:43:13,519
What brings you here?

655
00:43:14,599 --> 00:43:16,999
I came to see what Mother's

656
00:43:17,119 --> 00:43:18,959
new favorite looks like.

657
00:43:19,519 --> 00:43:21,120
Both of you, leave us.

658
00:43:21,440 --> 00:43:23,399
I have a few private words

659
00:43:23,400 --> 00:43:25,280
to say to this young lady.

660
00:43:25,559 --> 00:43:26,760
Well...

661
00:43:27,239 --> 00:43:28,559
I'm afraid we can't do that.

662
00:43:31,960 --> 00:43:33,120
What?

663
00:43:33,400 --> 00:43:34,999
Now that there's someone new,

664
00:43:35,239 --> 00:43:36,959
my word means nothing?

665
00:44:00,300 --> 00:44:04,420
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

666
00:44:07,260 --> 00:44:11,780
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

667
00:44:13,060 --> 00:44:16,980
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

668
00:44:17,660 --> 00:44:20,420
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

669
00:44:21,140 --> 00:44:23,460
♪Though all the world may fade♪

670
00:44:23,460 --> 00:44:26,540
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

671
00:44:28,060 --> 00:44:32,300
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

672
00:44:35,220 --> 00:44:39,380
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

673
00:44:41,180 --> 00:44:44,740
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

674
00:44:44,740 --> 00:44:48,300
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

675
00:44:49,100 --> 00:44:54,780
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

676
00:44:55,140 --> 00:44:59,460
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

677
00:44:59,820 --> 00:45:02,780
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

678
00:45:02,780 --> 00:45:06,540
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

679
00:45:06,540 --> 00:45:09,420
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

680
00:45:09,420 --> 00:45:13,500
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

681
00:45:13,500 --> 00:45:16,860
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

682
00:45:16,860 --> 00:45:20,620
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

683
00:45:20,620 --> 00:45:24,620
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

684
00:45:25,380 --> 00:45:29,540
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

685
00:45:29,540 --> 00:45:32,980
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

686
00:45:32,980 --> 00:45:36,620
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

687
00:45:36,620 --> 00:45:39,500
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

688
00:45:39,500 --> 00:45:43,580
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

689
00:45:43,580 --> 00:45:46,940
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

690
00:45:46,940 --> 00:45:50,580
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

691
